      "message": "It turns out the problem was that, at some point in the history of this CL, I accidentally changed cortex-m/build.mk to link with the armv6m runtime library instead of the armv7m runtime library. This led to the size increase which caused us to run out of flash space.\n\nFixing the CL to use the correct runtime library resolves the issue; space used is the same with or without the patch.",
      "revId": "f10b8d8214d0532c6d6274225fcae38d76c4dd1d",
